on-specific lipid contents, and cell-specific localizations of lipids depending on both cell subpopulations and anatomical origins of the cells. Our workflow establishes a blueprint for future developments of multiscale technologies for biochemical characterization of the brain.",exclude_uncertain_unstable,EXCLUDE,EC2_no_text_component,,primary_model_paper,no,no,no,no,,,,,"The abstract details a deep‑learning framework for mass‑spectrometry biochemical mapping but contains no mention of natural‑language text or a text‑bio bridge, leading to exclusion under EC2_no_text_component. | The abstract describes a deep‑learning‑based reconstruction framework for mass‑spectrometry imaging and does not mention any generative mechanism (e.g., decoder, autoregressive) or foundation‑model pretraining.","The abstract details a deep‑learning framework for mass‑spectrometry biochemical mapping but contains no mention of natural‑language text or a text‑bio bridge, leading to exclusion under EC2_no_text_component.","The abstract describes a deep‑learning‑based reconstruction framework for mass‑spectrometry imaging and does not mention any generative mechanism (e.g., decoder, autoregressive) or foundation‑model pretraining.",
