valuation rather than a new model.","evidence_snippet":"\"practical guideline for benchmarking\"; \"introduce a new set of tasks and metrics\""},{"record_id":"rec_000200","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The model combines histology, RNA-seq, and clinical variables for survival prediction, with no text or language component described. This is a multimodal bio model, but not a text-bio model.","evidence_snippet":"\"integrates whole-slide histology features, RNA-seq expression profiles, and clinical variables\""}]}
