es roles in disease. This is a review rather than a primary model paper.","evidence_snippet":"This review systematically organizes the multifaceted regulatory mechanisms of RNA-binding proteins in neuroinflammation"},{"record_id":"rec_000240","paper_type":"application_wrapper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_substantive_text_bio_bridge","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The work studies agentic LLM schemes for authoring genomics visualizations, not a candidate bio-foundational model. The LLM is used as a tooling layer for visualization generation.","evidence_snippet":"Agentic and large language model (LLM) approaches are increasingly applied to complex scientific tasks, including visualization"}]}
